{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56776","headline":"袁夸郎遇仙诗 夸郎赠封平仲诗 · 不详","name":"袁夸郎遇仙诗 夸郎赠封平仲诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝匣开玉琴，高梧追烦暑。\n商弦一以发，白云飘然举。\n何必苍梧东，激情怀怨浦。\n（见程毅中校本《玄怪录》卷四。\n（〖1〗《玄怪录》：陈朱崖太守袁洪儿，小名夸郎，年二十，罗得翠翠鸟，鸟化爲一婢，又结识封郎平仲。\n次日往访封郎，至一处宾馆宏敞，穷极瑰宝。\n复识王氏兄弟，又与封氏姨成婚。\n衆人吟诗鼓琴，夸郎遂无归思。\n奚诸人云他徙，回顾已无一物。\n夸郎数月犹惝恍，终岁乃如故。\n〖节录大意〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}